{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_6_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_6","textTraditional":"一、六年，春，鄭人來輸平。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_6_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_6","textTraditional":"輸平者何？輸平猶墮成也。何言乎墮成？敗其成也。曰「吾成敗矣」。吾與鄭人末有成也。吾與鄭人則曷為末有成？狐壤之戰，隱公獲焉。然則何以不言戰？諱獲也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_6_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_6","textTraditional":"二、夏，五月辛酉，公會齊侯盟于艾。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_6_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_6","textTraditional":"三、秋，七月。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_6_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_6","textTraditional":"此無事，何以書？春秋雖無事，首時過則書。首時過則何以書？春秋編年，四時具，然後為年。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_6_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_6","textTraditional":"四、冬，宋人取長葛。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_6_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_6","textTraditional":"外取邑不書，此何以書？久也。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}